        <item>
            <title>0.1.791</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:06:46 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/oliver-odgaard/orchestrator-releases</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/oliver-odgaard/orchestrator-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>791</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.791</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Added a choice of branch name prefix for workers: orc/ or your GitHub username.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li>Kept one chat history when switching the supervisor&#x27;s runtime, with a handoff note at each switch.</li>
<li>Grouped repeated chat alerts into one instead of showing each separately.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed cards waiting to install when a change ships with a release or needs no install.</li>
<li>Fixed Codex usage not showing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
