        <item>
            <title>0.1.787</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:53:53 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/oliver-odgaard/orchestrator-releases</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/oliver-odgaard/orchestrator-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>787</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.787</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Added OpenCode, Gemini CLI, Cursor&#x27;s agent and Grok as workers, and new Claude and Codex models now appear right away.</li>
<li>Added a live read-only view of a worker&#x27;s terminal and its code changes on each task card.</li>
<li>Added the option to ask the supervisor to change a worker&#x27;s runtime, model or effort for you.</li>
<li>Added plain-language notes describing what changed in each update.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li>Handled usage limits better: one alert, reset times on cards, and every affected task resumes on its own.</li>
<li>Let tasks that change the same files build on each other instead of waiting in line.</li>
<li>Transcribed iPhone dictation and showed Claude usage on the iPhone even when the Mac app window is closed.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed question cards with no options, cards covering the iPhone chat, sent text staying, and answered offers reopening.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/oliver-odgaard/orchestrator-releases/releases/download/v0.1.787/Orchestrator-0.1.787-8e77358a.zip" length="30120851" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="hmR5d3dwBhj1T9iwhkp3bn//sR5lS8PwtX/xagqpPHlzi5ag0nGwncBp9PgQ8dnOlnwR0BUsZw3o4u6BxNVWAw=="/>
        </item>
